        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that the term 'truth decay' warrants attention or discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker treats the idea of bipartisan balance on commissions as a meaningful structural constraint.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the requirement for bipartisan support as a check on power or legitimacy.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers it reasonable to question whether expanding investigations into social movements like Black Lives Matter constitutes a legitimate line of inquiry.",
        "confidence": 0.84
