  {
    "episode_id": 44476,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/4/44476.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Well, what do you think, though, of the fact that some of your own former Republican colleagues are saying, you know, this was just an ordinary day of tourism at the Capitol, that it wasn't violent, that it wasn't an insurrection. What's going on here?",
