        "text": "The speaker believes that the January 6th Capitol incident involved violence and constituted an insurrection.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects the listener to recognize the significance and gravity of the Capitol breach.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers the term 'insurrection' to be an accurate and appropriate description of the event.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views disagreement among former Republicans as politically motivated or disingenuous.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that the audience values consistency in political narratives regarding major historical events.",
